{"4610420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stamp Collector", "steam_appid": 4610420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying punching mechanics </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different Stamp Puncher machines to punch collectible items and create unique stamps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/2d729494adf602c7fd5bbfa74691ac10.poster.avif?t=1782235545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/2d729494adf602c7fd5bbfa74691ac10.webm?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/2d729494adf602c7fd5bbfa74691ac10.mp4?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize your collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the stamps you create into album pages, arrange them however you like, and build a collection that reflects your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/348279c524a52b0dc2e3b9def5100a4b.poster.avif?t=1782235545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/348279c524a52b0dc2e3b9def5100a4b.webm?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/348279c524a52b0dc2e3b9def5100a4b.mp4?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Wonderful People</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your stamp collection through buying and selling. Negotiate with customers, discover rare stamps, and expand your collection step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/21661ff6058cdc941c8afe09fa0a1425.poster.avif?t=1782235545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/21661ff6058cdc941c8afe09fa0a1425.webm?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/21661ff6058cdc941c8afe09fa0a1425.mp4?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create themes that reflect your taste and freely expand your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/0dc94171c1734bb5ca9b46297cdf1d56.poster.avif?t=1782235545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/0dc94171c1734bb5ca9b46297cdf1d56.webm?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610420/extras/0dc94171c1734bb5ca9b46297cdf1d56.mp4?t=1782235545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t forget to add &quot;Stamp Collector&quot; to your Steam wishlist!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying punching mechanics </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different Stamp Puncher machines to punch collectible items and create unique stamps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c